`,c.jsx(t.p,{children:"The reason was subtle. My deployment repository was completely empty. No commits. No main branch. The deployment action expected the destination branch to exist."}),`
`,c.jsx(t.p,{children:"Adding a single README created the initial commit, and the deployment worked on the next run."}),`
